<title>USA: Global Casinos Inc FY 96 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Global Casinos Inc FY 96 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 Months</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss   $0.17	    loss  $0.22</p>
<p> Net	loss   2,011	    loss  2,036</p>
<p> Revs		7,477		    7,303</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Included in 1996 were non-cash expenses of $2.051 million from a one-time impairment loss on non-operating gaming properties and depreciation and amortization of $826,115. Fiscal 1995 had non-cash expenses of $1.299 million from impairment of gaming facility, depreciation, amortization and a foreign currency loss of $116,841.</p>
